                "Hello! My name is <span class='mark'>Lina</span>. I want to tell you about my <span class='mark'>family</span>. <img src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511988617509-a57c8a288659' alt='Family photo' width='300'> I have a wonderful family. We are five people in total. Let me introduce everyone to you.",
                "First, my <span class='mark'>father</span>. His name is <span class='mark'>David</span>. He is forty-five years old. He works as a <span class='mark'>teacher</span> at a school. He teaches mathematics. My father loves his job. He says teaching children is very rewarding. After work, he likes to read <span class='mark'>books</span> in the living room. He reads many different books - history books, science books, and sometimes novels.",
                "My <span class='mark'>mother</span> is named <span class='mark'>Sarah</span>. She is forty-two years old. She works in an <span class='mark'>office</span> in the city center. She works with computers. My mother is an excellent cook. She makes delicious food every day. Her <span class='mark'>pasta</span> is my favorite. On weekends, she bakes cakes and cookies. The whole house smells wonderful when she bakes.",
                "I have two <span class='mark'>sisters</span>. My older sister is <span class='mark'>Emma</span>. She is fifteen years old. She goes to high school. Emma loves <span class='mark'>animals</span>. We have a cat named <span class='mark'>Whiskers</span>. Emma takes care of Whiskers every day. She gives him food and plays with him. My younger sister is <span class='mark'>Sophie</span>. She is only six years old. She goes to primary school. Sophie likes to draw and color.",
                "Now, let me describe our <span class='mark'>home</span>. We live in a <span class='mark'>house</span> with a red door. The house has two floors. On the first floor, we have a living room, a kitchen, and a dining room. The living room is big. There is a comfortable sofa and two armchairs. We watch television there in the evening. <img src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560448204-e02f11c3d0e2' alt='Living room' width='300'>",
                "The <span class='mark'>kitchen</span> is my mother's favorite room. It has modern appliances - a refrigerator, an oven, and a dishwasher. The dining room has a wooden table with six chairs. We eat all our meals there together.",
                "On the second floor, there are three <span class='mark'>bedrooms</span> and one bathroom. My parents have the biggest bedroom. Emma and I share a bedroom. Sophie has her own small bedroom. Our bedroom has two beds, two desks, and a bookshelf. We study at our desks in the evening.",
                "Our house has a <span class='mark'>garden</span> at the back. The garden is not very big, but it's beautiful. There are flowers of different colors - red roses, yellow daisies, and purple lavender. My father takes care of the garden. He waters the plants every evening. Sometimes we have <span class='mark'>picnics</span> in the garden on sunny days.",
                "We also have a small <span class='mark'>garage</span> where we keep our car. The car is blue. My father drives us to school every morning. In the afternoon, my mother picks us up.",
                "Every day follows a similar <span class='mark'>routine</span>. We wake up at seven o'clock. We have breakfast together at seven-thirty. Breakfast is usually cereal, milk, and fruit. Then we go to school and work. In the evening, we come home at about five o'clock. We do our homework, then we help with dinner preparation.",
